<title>USA: Zycad names financial officer.</title>
<headline>Zycad names financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zycad Corp on Tuesday said it had named Stephen Flory as its chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Flory, 41, has acting chief financial since the death of Peter Cassidy in August 1996. Cassidy had been Zycad's CFO since July, 1990.</p>
